WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Know who to contact first. The answers explain the priority.

00:02.000 --> 00:08.000
Hot: clear selling intent and a timeline within 3 months. Contact first.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Warm: interested in selling, but 3–6 months away. Agree on a follow-up date.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Cold: more than 6 months away, or exploring without near-term plans. Ask when to reconnect.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Hot: contact first. Warm: follow up. Cold: keep in touch. Priority uses timing and intent.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
The buyer still confirms contact and intent, authority to sell, and property details. Priority is not verification.
